r harness creates a channel or drives asynchronous search callbacks."],"recommended_action":"Add a stateful harness that initializes and configures an ares_channel_t, constructs a fuzz-controlled single-question ares_dns_record_t (including flags and optional records), invokes ares_search_dnsrec, supplies controlled DNS responses while driving the event loop, and validates callback completion and record lifetime across as-is and search-domain attempts."}
